  "analysis": "Key insight: The PDF uses an embedded font (CenturySchL-Roma, obj 8) with a ToUnicode mapping (obj 16) and a content stream (obj 5, FlateDecode). The notes are likely drawn as text glyphs rather than images. Let me decode the content stream and the ToUnicode table to understand the actual musical content.",
